==Trivia==
*Since [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] generally gets new events first, some enemies appeared in Zero Legends before their debut events in non-Japanese versions.
**[[Devil Wife]]'s first appearance was [[Attack of the Omens]] in BCJP, [[Cats Cradle Basin]] in other versions.
**[[Puffzerker]]'s first appearance was [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year#Arrival of the Red Ship|Arrival of the Red Ship]] in BCJP, [[A Journey of Moments]] in other versions.
**[[Commander Ostromeda]]'s first appearance was [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year#Arrival of the Blue Ship|Arrival of the Blue Ship]] in BCJP, [[Patisserie Parklands]] in other versions.

